  "details": "repo steps\n1.) have someone be in a state (private but not DND) where they'll show up as in a private world\n2.) send them a rq or an invite\n3.) have them not touch the notif but go into DND mode instead\nexpected: invite/rq should either cancel out in their notifs or just sit there as usual after going DND status\nactual: notif _will_ cancel out on their end, but the API will also send you a rq invite from said person afterwards even though they won't be able to receive it",
